">Overtime (${emp.regularOT}h reg + ${emp.holidayOT}h hol)</span><span class="font-medium">${fmt(emp.overtimePay)}</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-gray-500">Holiday Pay</span><span class="font-medium">${fmt(emp.holidayPay)}</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-gray-500">Night Diff (${emp.nightDiffHours}h)</span><span class="font-medium">${fmt(emp.nightDiff)}</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-gray-500">Bonuses</span><span class="font-medium">${fmt(emp.bonuses)}</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-gray-500">Other Earnings</span><span class="font-medium">${fmt(emp.otherEarnings)}</span></div></div><div class="mt-2 pt-2 border-t flex justify-between text-xs font-bold"><span class="text-green-800">Total Gross</span><span class="text-green-800">${fmt(emp.grossSalary)}</span></div></div><div class="bg-red-50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-red-200"><h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-red-600 uppercase mb-2">📋 Deductions</h4><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-1 text-xs"><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-gray-500">SSS</span><span class="font-medium">${fmt(emp.sss)}</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-gray-500">PhilHealth</span><span class="font-medium">${fmt(emp.philHealth)}</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-gray-500">Pag-IBIG</span><span class="font-medium">${fmt(emp.pagIbig)}</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-gray-500">Withholding Tax</span><span class="font-medium">${fmt(emp.withholdingTax)}</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-gray-500">SSS Loan</span><span class="font-medium">${fmt(emp.sssLoan)}</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-gray-500">Pag-IBIG Loan</span><span class="font-medium">${fmt(emp.pagIbigLoan)}</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-gray-500">Company Loan</span><span class="font-medium">${fmt(emp.companyLoan)}</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-gray-500">Absence Penalty</span><span class="font-medium">${fmt(emp.absencePenalty)}</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-gray-500">Late Penalty</span><span class="font-medium">${fmt(emp.latePenalty)}</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-gray-500">Unpaid Leave</span><span class="font-medium">${fmt(emp.unpaidLeave)}</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-gray-500">Other Deductions</span><span class="font-medium">${fmt(emp.otherDeductions)}</span></div></div><div class="mt-2 pt-2 border-t flex justify-between text-xs font-bold"><span class="text-red-700">Total Deductions</span><span class="text-red-700">${fmt(emp.totalDeductions)}</span></div></div>`;
